      161.85,
      228.77,
      401.84,
      240.11
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO LAY DOWN THE NATIONAL POLICY RELATING TO THE ABSORPTION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      241.49,
      401.85,
      290.99
    ],
    "text": "OF STUDENTS REGISTERED WITH THE SOUTH ASIAN INSTITUTE OFTECHNOLOGY AND MEDICINE TO THE GENERAL SIR JOHN KOTELAWALADEFENCE UNIVERSITY ESTABLISHED UNDER THE SIR JOHN KOTELAWALADEFENCE UNIVERSITY ACT, NO. 68 OF 1981 AND TO PROVIDE FOR",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      292.25,
      365.83,
      303.59
    ],
    "text": "MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL THERETO.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      317.69,
      401.88,
      341.75
    ],
    "text": "Be it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      355.85,
      401.9,
      417.95
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the General Sir JohnKotelawala Defence University (Special Provisions) Act, No.of 2018 and shall come into operation on such date as theMinister may appoint by Order published in the Gazette(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cappointed date\u201d).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      431.93,
      401.89,
      468.71
    ],
    "text": "2.The General Sir John Kotelawala Defence University(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cUniversity\u201d) shall have thepower-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.05,
      482.81,
      401.88,
      608.39
    ],
    "text": "(a)to absorb those students who have obtained basicqualifications from among the students who haveregistered with the South Asian Institute ofTechnology and Medicine (hereinafter referred toas the \u201cSAITM\u201d) between the period commencingfrom the fifteenth day of September Two ThousandNine and ending in the fifteenth day of May TwoThousand Seventeen, to the University to followthe study programme leading to the award of theMBBS Degree (KDU);",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.05,
      622.49,
      401.89,
      671.87
    ],
    "text": "(b)to award the MBBS Degree (KDU) to studentsabsorbed to the University under paragraph (a), whowould successfully complete the study programmeleading to the award of the MBBS Degree (KDU);",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      357.55,
      446.86,
      385.82
    ],
    "text": "Short titleand date ofoperation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      433.63,
      450.57,
      529.1
    ],
    "text": "Absorptionof studentsof SouthAsianInstitute ofTechnologyandMedicine totheUniversity.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
